# False-positive decomposition, six-tumor models without population site features on both references (ver4.6, 2026-11-26)

chr1, benchmark regions, PASS calls, seed 0. GRCh38-only = six-tumor model without population site features as a model input (m4m6_graphs_20261110/multicancer6_<P>_<KIND>_linear_nositef); HPRC v2.1 = six-tumor model without population site features as a model input (m6_nositef_graphs_20261118/multicancer6_<P>_<KIND>_d46_nositef; INDEL PASS ppr8, ONT pp). Share = % of the GRCh38-graph FP alleles; candidates retained = % of the alleles of that class with a tensor in the v2.1 test set of the same reads. In the HPRC v2.1 graph = carried by >= 46 of 463 HPRC v2.1 haplotypes. A class with fewer than 20 alleles shows "k of n" instead of the retained percentage; "-" = the class is empty; "<0.1%" = above zero and under 0.05 %.

